
~ LittleJoIntro

if GlobalVars.LittleJoBeaten
	Little Jo: Let's face again tomorrow !
	Little Jo: I'm gonna train a lot to beat you.
	Little Jo: Meanwhile, if you're looking for a challenge, go talk to my brothers.
	=> END
Little Jo : Hi ! I'm little Jo, the youngest brother of the Jo family.
Little Jo: I'm a bit busy, so what do you want ? 
- What are you doing ? 
	Little Jo: I'm playing a game. Can't you see ?
	- Can I play with you ? 
		Little Jo: Aren't you supposed to work ? 
		- No
			Little Jo: ...
			Little Jo: Why are you dressed like that then ?
			- It's my everyday outfit !
				Little Jo: So you never change your clothes !
				Little Jo: I guess you also never shower !
				Little Jo: You should be a strong opponent !
				Little Jo: Wanna play ?
				- Yes 
				- No 
					Billy : Okay ! See you later.
					=> END
			- I lied but I still want to play !
				Little Jo: Okay ! 
		- Yes 
			Little Jo: Then go work ! 
			=> END
	- Good Game then !
		Little Jo: Thanks !
		=> END	
~ AskTutorialLittleJo 
Little Jo: Do you know how to play ?
- Nah I need an explanation.
	$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/arcadeGame/level/FullArcadeGame.tscn"), {"opponent":0, "play_tutorial":true}])
- It's okay ! I already know the rules !
	$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/arcadeGame/level/FullArcadeGame.tscn"), {"opponent":0, "play_tutorial":false}])
=> END

~ Tutorial1
Little Jo: You play as the heart just there.
Little Jo: Try moving using [color=#ffd166][font_size=30]{{GlobalVars.get_action_controls("left")}} {{GlobalVars.get_action_controls("right")}}, {{GlobalVars.get_action_controls("up")}} {{GlobalVars.get_action_controls("down")}}[/font_size][/color].
=> END


~ Tutorial2 
Little Jo: See the ball right here. 
Little Jo: You can hit it using [color=#ffd166][font_size=30]{{GlobalVars.get_action_controls("interact2")}}[/font_size][/color].
Little Jo: The more you hit it the bigger it becomes, and the faster it goes.
Little Jo: You can also hold [color=#ffd166][font_size=30]{{GlobalVars.get_action_controls("interact2")}}[/font_size][/color] to aim the ball.
Little Jo: Try hitting it a couple of times to make it gain speed.
=> END

~ Tutorial3 
Little Jo: Now try hitting these targets ! Don't forget you can aim !
=> END

~ Tutorial4 
Little Jo: You mastered the basics ! Now you'll face me ! 
Little Jo: Try dodging or sending back the ball when it's my color !
=> END

		
~ BeatenLittleJo
$> GlobalVars.LittleJoBeaten = true
Little Jo: You learn quickly !
Little Jo: You should try playing against my brothers !
Little Jo: Who knows, maybe one day you'll be able to beat Jo. Ahaha !
Little Jo: ...
$> SoundManager.stop_music.emit()
Little Jo: It was a joke. 
Little Jo: Nobody beats Jo.
$> SoundManager.change_music.emit("Arcade")

=> END

~ WinLittleJo 
Little Jo: Better luck next time !
=> END

~ JoListerIntro
if GlobalVars.JoListerBeaten
	Jolister: I didn't really lose.
	Jolister: My hand was just a bit slippery that's it.
	=> END
Jolister : I'm Jolister. Middle child of the jo family.
if GlobalVars.LittleJoBeaten
	Jolister : So you've beaten our little brother.
	Jolister: Not that it proves anything but...
	Jolister: Would you care for a challenge ?
	- Yes
		Jolister: I'll avenge you little bro.
		$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/arcadeGame/level/FullArcadeGame.tscn"), {"opponent":1}])
		=> END
	- No 
		Jolister: Tss..
		=> END
Jolister: What do you want ?
- I want to play with you.
	Jolister: You dare to challenge me even though you couldn't even beat my little brother.
	Jolister: Go away and come back when you've learned the rules of the game.
	=> END
- Nothing. Just Watching.
	Jolister: Go watch someone else.
	=> END

~ BeatenJoLister 
$> GlobalVars.JoListerBeaten = true
Jolister: I couldn't avenge you, brother...
Jolister: I'm sorry...
Little Jo: Stop being such a drama queen.
Jolister: No one talked to you !
Little Jo: Jolister is a drama queen ! Haha.
Jolister: Everything's your fault ! Go away and let me play alone !
=> END

~ WinJoLister 
Jolister: You've been avenged little bro !
Little Jo: I'm still alive, you know !
Jolister: I can still hear your beautiful voice from here.
Little Jo: ...
Jolister: You.
Jolister : Come back whenever you want, I always like to carry a revenge.
Jolister: Especially when my opponent is this bad. Haha.
=> END

~ BigJoIntro
if GlobalVars.BigJoBeaten
	BigJo: ...
	=> END
if !GlobalVars.LittleJoBeaten and !GlobalVars.JoListerBeaten
	BigJo : ...
	BigJo: Don't want to be mean but...
	BigJo: You're still too weak.
	=> END
if GlobalVars.LittleJoBeaten and !GlobalVars.JoListerBeaten
	BigJo: ...
	BigJo: You've grown stronger.
	BigJo: But you're still weak.
	=> END
if GlobalVars.LittleJoBeaten and GlobalVars.JoListerBeaten
	BigJo: You have become worthy.
	BigJo: Let's face each other.
	- Yes
		BigJo: Our battle will be legendary.
		$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/arcadeGame/level/FullArcadeGame.tscn"), {"opponent":2}])
	- No 
		BigJo: No need to rush.
		BigJo: Come back when you feel ready.
=> END
		
~ BeatenBigJo
$> GlobalVars.BigJoBeaten = true
BigJo: It was a beautiful game.
BigJo: But I was never the final wall.
BigJo: Try interacting with the machine at the right.
BigJo: To truly become the best, one needs to beat the true Jo.
BigJo: It may be difficult but I know you can do it.
=> END

~ WinBigJo
BigJo: Don't feel ashamed.
BigJo: It was a good game.
BigJo: Come back whenever you want.
=> END

